      "source": "\r\n  1:\r\n    name: \"&8Chemical Mine\"\r\n    material: LIGHT_WEIGHTED_PRESSURE_PLATE\r\n    lore: |\r\n      {$desc}Gives some debuffs to the player\r\n      who stepped on the plate.\r\n\r\n      {$sp}Attributes{$colon}\r\n      {$dot} {$p}Durability{$colon} {? building_max_durability > 0 && building_durability <= 0 ? \"&4Broken\" : \"{$s}%building_durability%{$sep}/{$s}%building_max_durability%\" }\r\n      {$dot} {$p}Effects{$colon}\r\n          &8- {$s}Blindness lvl 1 for 30 seconds\r\n          &8- {$s}Nausea lvl 1 for 30 seconds\r\n",
